  "accepted_behavior": [
    "Explicit text opt-in uses the same owner admission, pool, Job, foreign queue, State, worker, data device per seat and actual reaper as native DnD; the public facade remains unchanged.",
    "Real Selection and keyboard focus survive zero endpoints; registration requires a newly emitted clipboard fence binding the exact SID and epoch, without a DnD Enter.",
    "One physical Sync scheduler alternates Arm and Clipboard with bounded seat round robin; original absolute callback deadline remains active for logical tombstones.",
    "Matching physical callback resolves the quarantine prefix inside dispatch: Done before Enter cannot revive the old Selection, while the opposite order can reuse it only after a fresh context seal.",
    "The seal samples fresh time after root and endpoint guards. Expired callbacks fail the owner with Timeout through normal cleanup and actual join, without a transient successful seal.",
    "Typed ReadTag distinguishes actual Drop and Text readers across State, Guest and Runtime. The validated claim supplies the actual byte cap, deadline and frozen MIME before the real Receive.",
